      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "APIARIST (7) is the horse to beat fresh, with his Wyong fifth before the break better than it reads after he was bumped and then unable to be properly tested in the straight. His trials coming in have been solid and he profiles strongly for a race of this calibre. Can return with a bang. DWIGHT (1) comes back from provincial company today and also comes back to 1100m. He's a speedy customer and with a handy draw on offer, he can work to the front and give them something to chase. DANLEO (9) has to convert trial form to race day, but a comfortable Hawkesbury trial win and barrier one give her genuine interest on debut. ELEGANT ANDERS (8) also debuts with claims after a close Warwick Farm trial third, and the stable's debut record gives him enough support to be respected first time out. DIAMOND DICE (10) won't be far away on what we've seen from her at the trials recently.",
